Ya can certainly make a note to exclude these apes from a future airdrop.

But it applies everywhere else in the same way - if an airdrop is tied to apes, people will scoop up unclaimed apes from anywhere possible - Blur, TokenWorks, OpenSea, solana:F1ceHtyqhe8gdcPb9ix8zyoWPy63Mx3m2WWL6Txtpump, etc.

Just the way it goes.

